WEBVTT

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:47.900
Tenjin Elementary

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:18.340
Don't, please don't!

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:57.930
No!

00:01:57.930 --> 00:01:59.140
Stop, please!

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:01.050
I don't want to die!

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:46.180
Onii-chan!

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:48.770
Y-You scared the hell out of me!

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:51.810
You really are a scaredy-cat, aren't you?

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:58.900
I-I'm not. I was just surprised because you suddenly opened the door.

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:01.360
Come on, hurry up and get out of the bath!

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:04.370
I'll wash your body!

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:05.620
Huh?

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:09.500
I already finished washing
myself, so you don't have to...

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:13.840
So you're done already...

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:15.380
Yuka?

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:20.260
Onii-chan, aren't you tired from all those preparations for the culture festival?

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:24.640
I thought I could relieve
some of the fatigue for you.

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:33.060
You're so kind, Yuka.

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:37.400
Huh?

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:39.360
I'll wash you nevertheless!

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:40.990
Come over here, quickly!

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:43.410
N-N-No, like I said...

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:44.320
Geez...

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:47.240
If you're like that, I'll just join you instead!

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:49.580
Hey, w-wait!

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:54.080
Tell me, tell me. Is there something between you and Mochida-kun?

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:55.840
What do you mean?

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:58.710
Naomi and Mochida-kun...

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:05.260
doing stuff like this,
and this, and also this!

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:08.180
And of course, something like this.

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:13.310
As if we'd do that!

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:17.650
Aww. How boring.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:20.110
Well, <i>sorry</i> for being so boring.

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:24.910
Same goes for Mochida-kun. Even though you're so attractive...

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:28.410
If I were him, I wouldn't
be able to resist myself!

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:31.120
Naomi-san!

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:32.660
Seiko, what are you...

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:36.170
H-Hey, st-stop that, Seiko...

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:37.920
Stop it!

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:45.300
Why are you sleeping in
my bed in the first place?!

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:49.350
I already prepared a futon for you.

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:54.480
Seiko...

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:56.400
Would you quit that alrea—

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:00.150
Quit what?

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:02.280
What?

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:05.660
D-Didn't you touch my butt just now...?

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:09.370
Naomi, are you sexually frustrated, by any chance?

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:14.370
Why don't you ask Mochida-kun for a "favor" at tomorrow's culture festival?

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:19.750
Good night!

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:24.720
Kisaragi Festival

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:26.720
Japanese Sweets Cafe

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:38.980
Suzumoto Mayu

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:40.900
Yes?

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:44.820
Hello, is this Morishige-kun?
This is the class president speaking.

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:47.990
Hey there, <i>Mayu</i>.

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:50.280
You got me.

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:52.290
So, what's up?

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:59.500
I thought I'd wish you good luck with tomorrow's culture festival.

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:02.130
That's all I wanted to say.

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:04.630
That's all...

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:07.090
Tomorrow's the last day, right?

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:10.050
The last day you'll come to school.

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:12.560
Yeah.

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:19.560
Oh well, nothing's going to change, apart from your transfer. We'll just be commuting to different schools.

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:22.190
We can still call each other like now.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:24.150
Yeah...

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:26.690
What, you want to change it?

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:30.950
What is it?

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:33.530
I want nothing to change!

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:36.040
Good. Honesty is a virtue.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:42.920
That's why there's nothing to be afraid of, Mayu.

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:46.800
If anything happens, contact me right away.

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:47.590
I will!

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:52.640
Got that? If so, I'm hanging up.
I'm rather busy, unlike you.

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:56.890
I got it. See you tomorrow, Shige-nii! Good night!

00:06:56.890 --> 00:06:57.850
Thanks.

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:06.730
Thank you, Shige-nii.

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:20.000
Coin Slot

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:26.050
Kishinuma-kun!

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:28.590
Oh, if it isn't Shinozaki!

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:29.300
What are you doing out so late?

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:30.300
Welcome!
What are you doing out so late?

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:30.970
What are you doing out so late?

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:36.600
Well, our printer has broken down, so...

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:39.270
Who're you looking for?

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:42.230
Just so you know, I didn't
bring Satoshi with me.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:44.900
Is that so...

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:45.980
Too bad.

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:56.030
H-Hey, do you want to go
to the karaoke bar right no—

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:56.830
Nope.

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:01.040
O-Okay.

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:05.290
Well, I guess you're having
a hard time studying.

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:07.550
I'm not studying.

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:12.590
You know, we're going to see Suzumoto-san
off after the end of the culture festival.

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:17.560
Oh, yeah... now that you mention it...

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:21.560
That's why we thought we should make a precious memory before she goes.

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:27.570
What's that?

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:33.820
We'll make good luck charms out of these dolls, so that we'll stay friends forever.

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:36.070
Good luck charms?

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:38.580
Exactly.

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:41.620
Hey, Kishinuma-kun...

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:23.620
Do you know of the "Fortunate Sachiko-san"?

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:34.420
Tenjin Elementary

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:50.690
Corpse Party
